# Source build output (in case someone runs src/build.ps1 from inside the skill)
# The skill itself doesn't compile the engine — install.ps1 downloads a
# prebuilt Vortex.dll. But if a contributor runs src\build.ps1 in this
# folder, the artifacts would otherwise land next to the runtime state.
# Defensive: the canonical build is run from the .NET source repo
# (Cloudmeru/vortex-os-dotnet), never from inside the skill.
Vortex.dll
Vortex.psm1
Vortex.psd1
ijwhost.dll
*.aps
*.pch
*.vspscc
*.vssscc

# IDE
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.user
*.suo
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates

# OS junk
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
desktop.ini
ehthumbs.db
ehthumbs_vista.db

# PowerShell
*.ps1xml~

# Skill runtime state (regenerated on every dispatch)
state/
memory/
swarms/
tasks/
deliverables/
# templates/ holds the Golden Path *examples* shipped with the skill
# (iteration_pattern.json, episode_pattern.json). These are tracked in git.
# User-created templates (anything else under templates/) are still ignored.
templates/*
!templates/*.json
!templates/*.schema.json

# Engineering reference material (not user-facing):
#   docs/         -- the PRD documents for each phase
#   idea-*.md     -- the design notebook (ADRs, FAQs, future-recommendations)
# These stay in git history for traceability but are no longer shipped
# in the working tree (they were moved to the platform wiki in v0.3.2).
docs/
idea-*.md

# Vortex-OS audit/check cache files (would be regenerated on every run)
state/auto-update-check.json

walkthrough/slides/imgs/_gen_*.json

# Walkthrough build artifacts (regenerated by the v0.3.4 media-tutorial-video recipe
# or by hand-rolled media builds). Keep the source slides + index.html tracked;
# the rendered MP4, generated slide images, intermediate audio, and helper scripts
# are not part of the skill.
walkthrough/build/
walkthrough/vortex-os-walkthrough.mp4
walkthrough/slides/imgs/slide-*.jpg

# Release artifacts (built by .github/workflows/release.yml)
*.zip

# OS file-copy artifacts (Dropbox / OneDrive / Explorer "save a copy")
LICENSE - Copy
LICENSE.*
!*LICENSE

